# Eden, Seat of the Sanctum: "When you do, return another target permanent card from your graveyard to your hand." On turn 2 Bot2's Lotus Petal
# pays for a Lightning Bolt at Bot1's Ornithopter, so each graveyard holds a permanent card. On turn 3 Eden mills a Lightning Bolt and a Memnite
# and is sacrificed: the milled Bolt (an instant, no permanent card), Bot2's Lotus Petal (in Bot2's graveyard, not Bot1's) and Eden itself (not
# another card) are refused as the target; Bot1's Ornithopter and Memnite are the legal ones, and the Memnite returns.

[Bot1 Deck]
Eden, Seat of the Sanctum
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Ornithopter
Forest
Lightning Bolt
Memnite
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Lotus Petal
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Eden, Seat of the Sanctum.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter
? Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Lotus Petal
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Eden, Seat of the Sanctum.Activate(Ability: #2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 4
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Eden, Seat of the Sanctum)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Lightning Bolt)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Graveyard.Lotus Petal)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Memnite
Bot1.Graveyard = Eden, Seat of the Sanctum; Lightning Bolt; Ornithopter
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Lotus Petal
